<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Sept jobless rises to 3.2 pct (3.1 pct).</title>
<headline>Czech Sept jobless rises to 3.2 pct (3.1 pct).</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of jobless in the Czech Republic rose to 169,024 in September or 3.2 percent of the workforce up from 3.1 percent in August, the Ministry of Labour and Social Affairs said on Thursday.  </p>
<p> CZECH UNEMPLOYMENT	  SEPT 1996     AUG 1996    SEPT 1995</p>
<p>  number of jobless	   169,024	162,978	154,048</p>
<p>  pct of workforce	     3.2	     3.1	    3.0</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
